        "@value": "Night Howl at Chez Pierre Cabaret @ Chez Pierre Cabaret - Apr 24, 2026, 7:00PM"
      }
    ],
    "http://opengraphprotocol.org/schema/description": [
      {
        "@value": "Night Howl is playing the historic Chez Pierre Cabaret on April 24! Come on down to this sassy lil' pub for some live music and live dancers! 🍑 Chez Pierre Cabaret 🍑 Fri. April. 24, 7:00 Doors | 8:00 Show, $20 at the door 🍑 Oh and this show does contain nudity my friends 😉🌷🌮"
      }
    ],
